<body>
<main>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: November 16, 2026</p>

  <p>This policy explains what information the Dragonfly app and the website at baccaratfunk.win ("the Service") collect, how it is used, and the choices you have. The Service is run by Grand Illusion Entertainment ("we", "us").</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only what the Service needs to work:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email address.</strong> When you sign in, we collect your email address. We use it only for login, to identify your account and let you sign in. We do not use it for marketing or advertising, and we do not sell or share it for those purposes.</li>
    <li><strong>Session and activity data.</strong> When you use the app, it sends your session information to our server so it can be saved and restored later.</li>
    <li><strong>Device identifier.</strong> When you sign in, we create an identifier for your device so that your login session only works on the device you signed in with. We use it for security, not for advertising or tracking you across other apps or sites.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data.</strong> Like most online services, our servers receive your IP address, device and browser type, and request times when your app or browser connects. This is used to deliver the Service and keep it secure.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not ask for your precise location, contacts, photos, or microphone access.</p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To let you sign in to your account (the only use of your email address).</li>
    <li>To run the app and save and restore your sessions.</li>
    <li>To keep the Service secure, prevent abuse, and fix problems.</li>
    <li>To understand how the Service is used so we can improve it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for advertising.</p>

  <h2>Who handles your data</h2>
  <p>We use third-party providers to operate the Service. They process data on our behalf and only to provide their services:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> delivers the website and runs the server that receives data from the app.</li>
    <li><strong>Google</strong> (Google Apps Script and related Google services) stores the data the app saves.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Play</strong> distributes the app and may collect its own information under Google's privacy policy.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also disclose information if the law requires it or to protect the rights and safety of our users and the Service.</p>

  <h2>Data security</h2>
  <p>Data sent between the app and our server is encrypted in transit using HTTPS. No system is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
  <p>We keep session data for as long as it is needed to provide the Service, or until you ask us to delete it. Server logs are kept for a limited time and then removed.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and deletion requests</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to tell you what data we hold about you or to delete it. To delete your account, follow the steps on our <a href="/delete-account.html">account deletion page</a>. For any other request, email us at <a href="mailto:grandillusione@gmail.com">grandillusione@gmail.com</a> and include enough detail for us to find your data. We will respond within a reasonable time. You can also stop all data collection by uninstalling the app and no longer using the website.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The Service is intended for adults and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children. If you believe a child has given us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will change the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the Service after a change means you accept the updated policy.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:grandillusione@gmail.com">grandillusione@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
